      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Before: fixed K; solve only for P.\nNow: find X and Y at a trial rate r.\n[ r^2 X    G^T ]\n[ G            X ]  >= 0\nG = A X  and  A X - B Y\ntrace(X) = 3;  X >= 10^-7 I",
      "originalText": "Before: fixed K; solve only for P.\nNow: find X and Y at a trial rate r.\n[ r^2 X    G^T ]\n[ G            X ]  >= 0\nG = A X  and  A X - B Y\ntrace(X) = 3;  X >= 10^-7 I",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
