      "locked": false,
      "text": "Repeat the SDP for each trial rate r.\nStart above the spectral radius of A.\nCheck each result independently.\nTighten the bracket to width <=10^-6.\nRate, not timing effort or nonlinear\ncost, is the synthesis objective.",
      "originalText": "Repeat the SDP for each trial rate r.\nStart above the spectral radius of A.\nCheck each result independently.\nTighten the bracket to width <=10^-6.\nRate, not timing effort or nonlinear\ncost, is the synthesis objective.",
