      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Recover K = Y X^-1 and P = X^-1.\nExport Kphys = (10 us) K S^-1.\nUse the existing MATLAB simulator.\nRun the same 1x/2x/3x error trials.\nCompare convergence, J100 and timing\nagainst LQR and MPC-5 baselines.",
      "originalText": "Recover K = Y X^-1 and P = X^-1.\nExport Kphys = (10 us) K S^-1.\nUse the existing MATLAB simulator.\nRun the same 1x/2x/3x error trials.\nCompare convergence, J100 and timing\nagainst LQR and MPC-5 baselines.",
