      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The open endpoint limits the robust rate. The feasible gain is nonunique; a new gain is not automatically better.\nCommon-P covers conditioned linearized dynamics only. Exact-plant trials remain simulation evidence, not a global stability proof.",
